{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20152","headline":"宇文秀才斋中海柳咏 · 孟郊","name":"宇文秀才斋中海柳咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉缕青葳蕤，结爲芳树姿。\n忽惊明月钩，钩出珊瑚枝。\n灼灼不死花，蒙蒙长生丝。\n饮栢泛仙味，咏兰拟古词。\n霜风清飕飕，与君长相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}